kant-groundwork-4.md:1: argue/negation: kant-groundwork-4.logic.r1 P6 (S5): the sentence says "nothing", but P6 denies nothing it speaks of: it reads "The subject of all possible ends is also the subject of a possible absolutely good will" [in 1 of 2 runs]
